#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CacheStatsPanel.php:40
msgid "Translation Caching"
msgstr "Caché de traducción"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CacheStatsPanel.php:44
msgid ""
"Lingua Forge uses two independent caching layers to avoid redundant AI API "
"calls. Use the tabs below to inspect and manage each one."
msgstr ""
"Lingua Forge usa dos capas de caché independientes para evitar llamadas "
"redundantes a la API de IA. Use las pestañas a continuación para "
"inspeccionar y gestionar cada una."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CacheStatsPanel.php:61
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CacheStatsPanel.php:93
#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsHelp.php:170
msgid "API Response Cache"
msgstr "Caché de respuestas API"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CacheStatsPanel.php:64
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CacheStatsPanel.php:180
#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsHelp.php:172
msgid "Translation Memory"
msgstr "Memoria de traducción"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CacheStatsPanel.php:66
msgid "(disabled)"
msgstr "(desactivado)"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CacheStatsPanel.php:76
msgid ""
"Per-post cache for AI-generated translations, meta descriptions, excerpts, "
"and content. Entries are invalidated automatically when the content or AI "
"provider/model changes."
msgstr ""
"Caché por publicación para traducciones generadas por IA, descripciones "
"meta, extractos y contenido. Las entradas se invalidan automáticamente "
"cuando el contenido o el proveedor/modelo de IA cambian."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CacheStatsPanel.php:103
msgid "Enable API response caching"
msgstr "Habilitar caché de respuestas API"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CacheStatsPanel.php:106
msgid ""
"The API Response Cache stores the raw result of every AI request — "
"translation, meta description, excerpt, and content generation — keyed by a "
"hash of the inputs (content, language pair, provider, model). Disable during "
"prompt tuning or when you need every request to reach the AI provider. "
"Disabling does not delete cached entries — re-enabling restores them."
msgstr ""
"La caché de respuestas de la API almacena el resultado en bruto de cada "
"solicitud de IA — traducción, descripción meta, extracto y generación de "
"contenido — identificada por un hash de las entradas (contenido, par de "
"idiomas, proveedor, modelo). Desactívala durante la afinación de prompts o "
"cuando necesites que cada solicitud llegue al proveedor de IA. La "
"desactivación no elimina las entradas en caché — volver a activarla las "
"restaura."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CacheStatsPanel.php:111
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CacheStatsPanel.php:198
msgid "Save"
msgstr "Guardar"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CacheStatsPanel.php:117
msgid "Cached API responses"
msgstr "Respuestas API en caché"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CacheStatsPanel.php:121
msgid "API calls saved by cache"
msgstr "Llamadas API guardadas por caché"

#. translators: %s is the average hits per cached entry.
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CacheStatsPanel.php:127
#, php-format
msgid "(avg %.1f hits/entry)"
msgstr "(promedio %.1f aciertos/entrada)"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CacheStatsPanel.php:135
msgid "Oldest cached response"
msgstr "Respuesta en caché más antigua"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CacheStatsPanel.php:139
msgid "Most recent cached response"
msgstr "Respuesta en caché más reciente"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CacheStatsPanel.php:149
msgid ""
"Clear all cached AI results? Future requests will trigger fresh API calls "
"until the cache rebuilds."
msgstr ""
"¿Borrar todos los resultados en caché de IA? Las solicitudes futuras "
"activarán llamadas API nuevas hasta que se reconstruya la caché."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CacheStatsPanel.php:153
msgid "Clear API Response Cache"
msgstr "Borrar caché de respuestas API"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CacheStatsPanel.php:163
msgid ""
"Block-level translation cache shared across posts. When enabled, identical "
"blocks (same markup, language pair, and glossary) are served from memory "
"instead of calling the AI again. Glossary edits and Compliance preset "
"changes automatically invalidate affected cached translations."
msgstr ""
"Caché de traducción a nivel de bloque compartida entre publicaciones. Cuando "
"está habilitado, bloques idénticos (mismo marcado, par de idiomas y "
"glosario) se sirven desde la memoria en lugar de llamar a la IA nuevamente. "
"Las ediciones del glosario y los cambios en el preajuste de cumplimiento "
"invalidan automáticamente las traducciones en caché afectadas."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CacheStatsPanel.php:190
msgid "Enable block-level translation cache reuse across posts"
msgstr ""
"Habilitar reutilización de caché de traducción a nivel de bloque en varias "
"publicaciones"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CacheStatsPanel.php:193
msgid ""
"Currently skipped for posts that use block-comment attribute placeholders "
"(wp:details summary fields, etc.) — they fall through to the existing single-"
"call translation path."
msgstr ""
"Actualmente se omite para publicaciones que usan marcadores de atributos de "
"comentario de bloque (campos wp:details, resumen, etc.) — estos pasan a la "
"ruta de traducción de llamada única existente."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CacheStatsPanel.php:204
msgid "Cached block translations"
msgstr "Traducciones de bloques en caché"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CacheStatsPanel.php:208
msgid "Block translation reuses"
msgstr "Reutilizaciones de traducción de bloques"

#. translators: %s is the average hits per cached block.
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CacheStatsPanel.php:214
#, php-format
msgid "(avg %.1f hits/block)"
msgstr "(promedio %.1f hits/bloque)"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CacheStatsPanel.php:222
msgid "Oldest cached block"
msgstr "Bloque en caché más antiguo"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CacheStatsPanel.php:226
msgid "Most recent cached block"
msgstr "Bloque en caché más reciente"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CacheStatsPanel.php:231
msgid "Approximate size"
msgstr "Tamaño aproximado"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CacheStatsPanel.php:240
msgid ""
"Clear the entire Translation Memory? Future translations will rebuild the "
"cache as they run."
msgstr ""
"¿Borrar toda la Memoria de Traducción? Las traducciones futuras "
"reconstruirán la caché a medida que se ejecuten."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CacheStatsPanel.php:245
msgid "Clear Translation Memory"
msgstr "Borrar Memoria de Traducción"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CacheStatsPanel.php:304
msgid "API Response Cache setting saved."
msgstr "Configuración de caché de respuesta API guardada."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CacheStatsPanel.php:312
msgid "Translation Memory setting saved."
msgstr "Configuración de memoria de traducción guardada."

#. translators: %d: number of cache entries removed.
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CacheStatsPanel.php:323
#, php-format
msgid "AI cache cleared. %d entry was removed."
msgid_plural "AI cache cleared. %d entries were removed."
msgstr[0] "Caché de IA limpiada. Se eliminó %d entrada."
msgstr[1] "Caché de IA limpiada. Se eliminaron %d entradas."

#. translators: %d: number of cached blocks removed.
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CacheStatsPanel.php:338
#, php-format
msgid "Translation Memory cleared. %d cached block was removed."
msgid_plural "Translation Memory cleared. %d cached blocks were removed."
msgstr[0] "Memoria de traducción borrada. Se eliminó %d bloque en caché."
msgstr[1] "Memoria de traducción borrada. Se eliminaron %d bloques en caché."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:77
msgid ""
"Lingua Forge is a complete multilingual SEO solution. No additional SEO "
"plugin is required."
msgstr ""
"Lingua Forge es una solución completa de SEO multilingüe. No se requiere "
"ningún plugin adicional de SEO."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:85
msgid ""
"If you have a general SEO plugin installed, this panel shows how LF adapts "
"to avoid duplicate output. The goal is collision avoidance — not "
"cooperation. LF always provides the multilingual SEO layer (hreflang, og:"
"locale, inLanguage schema) that requires knowledge of LF's language routing "
"configuration to produce correctly."
msgstr ""
"Si tienes instalado un plugin SEO general, este panel muestra cómo LF se "
"adapta para evitar salidas duplicadas. El objetivo es evitar colisiones, no "
"cooperación. LF siempre proporciona la capa SEO multilingüe (hreflang, og:"
"locale, esquema inLanguage) que requiere conocimiento de la configuración de "
"enrutamiento de LF para producirse correctamente."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:93
msgid "Installed SEO plugins"
msgstr "Plugins SEO instalados"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:98
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/SystemPanel.php:560
msgid "Plugin"
msgstr "Complemento"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:99
msgid "Status"
msgstr "Estado"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:108
msgid "✓ Active"
msgstr "✓ Activo"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:110
msgid "— Not detected"
msgstr "— No detectado"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:120
msgid ""
"No conflicting SEO plugins detected. Lingua Forge is handling all SEO output "
"independently."
msgstr ""
"No se detectaron plugins de SEO en conflicto. Lingua Forge maneja toda la "
"salida de SEO de forma independiente."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:125
msgid "What LF provides — and collision avoidance"
msgstr "Lo que proporciona LF — y prevención de colisiones"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:130
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/UsageStatsPanel.php:153
#: ai/includes/Core/PrivacyIntegration.php:117
msgid "Feature"
msgstr "Función"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:131
msgid "LF provides"
msgstr "LF proporciona"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:132
msgid "When another SEO plugin is installed"
msgstr "Cuando se instala otro plugin SEO"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:139
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/SeoTab.php:50
msgid "Hreflang"
msgstr "Hreflang"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:142
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:179
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:211
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:237
msgid "Disabled (by setting)"
msgstr "Desactivado (por configuración)"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:145
msgid "✓ LF outputs — plugin hreflang suppressed"
msgstr "✓ Salidas LF — plugin hreflang suprimido"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:149
msgid "✓ LF outputs"
msgstr "✓ Salidas LF"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:155
msgid ""
"LF outputs accurate hreflang for every configured language, including x-"
"default. General SEO plugins have no access to your LF routing configuration "
"and would produce hreflang based on incorrect URL assumptions. LF suppresses "
"their output via filter to prevent collisions."
msgstr ""
"LF proporciona hreflang precisos para cada idioma configurado, incluido x-"
"default. Los plugins de SEO generales no tienen acceso a la configuración de "
"enrutamiento de LF y producirían hreflang basados en suposiciones "
"incorrectas de URL. LF suprime su salida mediante filtro para evitar "
"colisiones."

#. translators: %s: comma-separated list of suppressed plugin names
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:163
#, php-format
msgid "Suppressed: %s."
msgstr "Suprimido: %s."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:176
msgid "Open Graph"
msgstr "Open Graph"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:181
msgid "Disabled (mode setting)"
msgstr "Desactivado (configuración de modo)"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:184
msgid "→ Locale tags only — deferring base OG to plugin"
msgstr "→ Solo etiquetas de idioma — aplazando OG base a plugin"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:188
msgid "→ Locale tags only (manual setting)"
msgstr "→ Solo etiquetas de idioma (configuración manual)"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:192
msgid "✓ LF outputs full OG + Twitter Cards"
msgstr "✓ Salidas LF OG completo + Tarjetas de Twitter"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:198
msgid ""
"LF always adds og:locale and og:locale:alternate — the multilingual OG "
"signals no general SEO plugin can produce correctly. For the base OG set (og:"
"title, og:description, og:image), LF outputs it when no other plugin is "
"present. When a SEO plugin is installed, LF skips the base set to avoid "
"duplicate tags — not because the plugin is \"better\", but because "
"duplication produces no value."
msgstr ""
"LF siempre añade og:locale y og:locale:alternate — las señales multilingües "
"que ningún plugin SEO puede producir correctamente. Para el conjunto OG base "
"(og:title, og:description, og:image), LF lo genera cuando no hay otro plugin "
"presente. Cuando se instala un plugin SEO, LF omite el conjunto base para "
"evitar etiquetas duplicadas — no porque el plugin sea \"mejor\", sino porque "
"la duplicación no aporta valor."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:208
msgid "Schema.org JSON-LD"
msgstr "JSON-LD de Schema.org"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:214
msgid "— Deferred to plugin"
msgstr "— Relegado al plugin"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:218
msgid "✓ LF outputs Article / WebPage / WebSite"
msgstr "✓ Salidas LF Artículo / Página Web / Sitio Web"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:224
msgid ""
"LF outputs multilingual JSON-LD with inLanguage annotations tied to its "
"language routing configuration. When a SEO plugin is installed, LF disables "
"its own schema entirely: duplicate JSON-LD graphs produce validation errors "
"and there is no clean way to supplement an existing graph."
msgstr ""
"LF genera JSON-LD multilingüe con anotaciones inLanguage vinculadas a su "
"configuración de enrutamiento de idiomas. Cuando se instala un plugin de "
"SEO, LF desactiva su propio esquema por completo: los gráficos JSON-LD "
"duplicados producen errores de validación y no hay una forma sencilla de "
"complementar un gráfico existente."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:234
msgid "XML Sitemap"
msgstr "Mapa del sitio XML"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:240
msgid "✓ Active at /lf-sitemap.xml"
msgstr "✓ Activo en /lf-sitemap.xml"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:246
msgid ""
"LF generates its own sitemap with xhtml:link alternates for all translation "
"groups. When a SEO plugin is installed, it generates a separate sitemap — "
"both coexist independently. Submit both to Google Search Console: the SEO "
"plugin sitemap for content discovery, the LF sitemap for language "
"relationship signals."
msgstr ""
"LF genera su propio mapa del sitio con alternativos xhtml:link para todos "
"los grupos de traducción. Cuando se instala un plugin SEO, genera un mapa "
"del sitio separado — ambos coexisten de forma independiente. Envía ambos a "
"Google Search Console: el mapa del sitio del plugin SEO para descubrimiento "
"de contenido, el mapa del sitio de LF para señales de relación de idioma."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:256
msgid "Canonical tag"
msgstr "Etiqueta canónica"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:260
msgid "✓ WP canonical replaced (self-referencing)"
msgstr "✓ Se reemplazó el canonical de WP (auto-referenciado)"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:263
msgid "WP core canonical active (hreflang disabled)"
msgstr "Canonical de WP core activo (hreflang desactivado)"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:268
msgid ""
"LF removes the WordPress core canonical tag and replaces it with a self-"
"referencing canonical pointing to the correct language-prefixed URL. When a "
"third-party SEO plugin (Yoast, Rank Math, AIOSEO, SEOPress) is active, LF "
"defers canonical management to that plugin entirely."
msgstr ""
"LF elimina la etiqueta canónica principal de WordPress y la reemplaza con "
"una canónica que se refiere a la URL correcta con prefijo de idioma. Cuando "
"un plugin de SEO de terceros (Yoast, Rank Math, AIOSEO, SEOPress) está "
"activo, LF delega la gestión canónica a ese plugin por completo."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:281
msgid "Legacy lf-social-share mu-plugin"
msgstr "Plugin mu legada lf-social-share"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:285
msgid "The lf-social-share mu-plugin is active."
msgstr "El plugin mu lf-social-share está activo."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:287
msgid ""
"Lingua Forge's built-in Social Share and Open Graph modules cover all "
"functionality the mu-plugin provides, plus multilingual og:locale support. "
"You can safely deactivate the mu-plugin."
msgstr ""
"Los módulos integrados de Compartir en Redes Sociales y Open Graph de Lingua "
"Forge cubren toda la funcionalidad que proporciona el plugin mu, además de "
"soporte multilingüe para og:locale. Puedes desactivar con seguridad el "
"plugin mu."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:294
msgid ""
"OG/Twitter Card tags: handled by LF's Open Graph module (SEO → Open Graph & "
"Twitter Cards)"
msgstr ""
"Etiquetas OG/Twitter Card: gestionadas por el módulo Open Graph de LF (SEO → "
"Open Graph & Twitter Cards)"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:295
msgid ""
"Social Icons block share: URLs: handled by LF's built-in Social Share (SEO → "
"Social Share)"
msgstr ""
"Compartir en bloque de iconos sociales: URLs: gestionado por la función "
"integrada de Compartir en redes sociales de LF (SEO → Compartir en redes "
"sociales)"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:296
msgid "copy/native/auto JS actions: handled by LF's social-share.js"
msgstr ""
"acciones JS nativas/automáticas/copiar: gestionadas por LF's social-share.js"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:300
msgid ""
"While active, the mu-plugin handles the base OG set and LF emits locale tags "
"only (auto mode). Removing it switches LF to full OG mode automatically."
msgstr ""
"Mientras está activo, el plugin mu maneja el conjunto base de OG y LF emite "
"solo etiquetas de idioma (modo automático). Quitar esto cambia LF a modo "
"completo de OG automáticamente."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/DebugFilesPanel.php:40
msgid "Debug Files"
msgstr "Archivos de depuración"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/DebugFilesPanel.php:44
msgid ""
"When debug logging is enabled (via the toggle below or by defining "
"LINGUAFORGE_AI_DEBUG in wp-config.php), the Translation and FSE template "
"translation features write their raw AI prompts and responses to disk for "
"troubleshooting. Use this section to monitor that output and clear it once "
"you have what you need — the files can grow quickly on large pages. "
"Configure the destination directory via the linguaforge_debug_dir filter."
msgstr ""
"Cuando la depuración de registros está habilitada (a través del interruptor "
"a continuación o definiendo LINGUAFORGE_AI_DEBUG en wp-config.php), las "
"funciones de traducción y traducción de plantillas FSE escriben sus "
"solicitudes y respuestas de AI en disco para solucionar problemas. Usa esta "
"sección para monitorear esa salida y borrarla una vez que tengas lo que "
"necesitas; los archivos pueden crecer rápidamente en páginas grandes. "
"Configura el directorio de destino a través del filtro linguaforge_debug_dir."

#. translators: %d: number of debug files removed.
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/DebugFilesPanel.php:59
#, php-format
msgid "Debug files cleared. %d file was removed."
msgid_plural "Debug files cleared. %d files were removed."
msgstr[0] "Archivos de depuración borrados. Se eliminó %d archivo."
msgstr[1] "Archivos de depuración borrados. Se eliminaron %d archivos."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/DebugFilesPanel.php:75
msgid "Debug logging enabled."
msgstr "Registro de depuración habilitado."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/DebugFilesPanel.php:77
msgid "Debug logging disabled."
msgstr "Registro de depuración deshabilitado."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/DebugFilesPanel.php:90
msgid "Debug logging"
msgstr "Depuración"

