#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/OpenGraphPanel.php:49
msgid ""
"Lingua Forge outputs Open Graph and Twitter Card meta tags so shared URLs "
"display the correct language, title, description, and image on social "
"platforms."
msgstr ""
"Lingua Forge genera meta etiquetas Open Graph y Twitter Card para que las "
"URLs compartidas muestren el idioma, título, descripción e imagen correctos "
"en las plataformas sociales."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/OpenGraphPanel.php:57
msgid ""
"Unlike hreflang — where LF always overrides other plugins because they "
"cannot know your multilingual configuration — Open Graph is different: "
"Yoast, Rank Math, and similar plugins already output correct OG tags for "
"your content. Duplicating them adds no value. In auto mode, LF detects "
"active SEO plugins and adds only what they cannot provide: og:locale "
"(current language) and og:locale:alternate (all other configured languages)."
msgstr ""
"A diferencia de hreflang — donde LF siempre anula otros plugins porque no "
"pueden conocer tu configuración multilingüe — Open Graph es diferente: "
"Yoast, Rank Math y plugins similares ya generan etiquetas OG correctas para "
"tu contenido. Duplicarlas no aporta valor. En modo automático, LF detecta "
"plugins SEO activos y añade solo lo que no puedan proporcionar: og:locale "
"(idioma actual) y og:locale:alternate (todos los demás idiomas configurados)."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/OpenGraphPanel.php:68
msgid "Open Graph settings saved."
msgstr "Configuraciones de Open Graph guardadas."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/OpenGraphPanel.php:79
msgid "Open Graph output"
msgstr "Salida de Open Graph"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/OpenGraphPanel.php:88
msgid "Output Open Graph tags in wp_head"
msgstr "Generar etiquetas Open Graph en wp_head"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/OpenGraphPanel.php:94
msgid "Output mode"
msgstr "Modo de salida"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/OpenGraphPanel.php:99
msgid "Auto (recommended)"
msgstr "Auto (recomendado)"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/OpenGraphPanel.php:101
msgid ""
"Detect active SEO plugins (Yoast, Rank Math, etc.) at runtime. Emit only og:"
"locale + og:locale:alternate when another plugin already outputs the full OG "
"set; emit the complete set when none is detected."
msgstr ""
"Detecta plugins SEO activos (Yoast, Rank Math, etc.) en tiempo de ejecución. "
"Emite solo og:locale + og:locale:alternate cuando otro plugin ya genera el "
"conjunto completo de OG; emite el conjunto completo cuando no se detecta "
"ninguno."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/OpenGraphPanel.php:105
msgid "Locale only"
msgstr "Solo localización"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/OpenGraphPanel.php:107
msgid ""
"Always emit only og:locale and og:locale:alternate. Use when another plugin "
"or theme handles the full OG set."
msgstr ""
"Siempre emitir solo og:locale y og:locale:alternate. Usar cuando otro plugin "
"o tema maneja el conjunto completo de OG."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/OpenGraphPanel.php:111
msgid "Full"
msgstr "Completo"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/OpenGraphPanel.php:113
msgid ""
"Always emit the complete OG + Twitter Card set regardless of other plugins. "
"Use only if no other plugin outputs OG tags."
msgstr ""
"Siempre emitir el conjunto completo de OG + Tarjeta de Twitter "
"independientemente de otros plugins. Usar solo si ningún otro plugin genera "
"etiquetas OG."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/OpenGraphPanel.php:117
msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "Desactivado"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/OpenGraphPanel.php:119
msgid "Do not output any OG tags."
msgstr "No mostrar ninguna etiqueta OG."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/OpenGraphPanel.php:126
msgid "Default OG image"
msgstr "Imagen OG predeterminada"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/OpenGraphPanel.php:137
msgid ""
"Fallback image URL used when a page has no featured image, site logo, or "
"site icon. Shown in social previews for archives, the blog index, and any "
"singular page without a thumbnail."
msgstr ""
"URL de imagen de respaldo utilizada cuando una página no tiene imagen "
"destacada, logotipo del sitio o icono del sitio. Se muestra en vistas "
"previas sociales para archivos, el índice del blog y cualquier página "
"singular sin miniatura."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/OpenGraphPanel.php:151
msgid "— Disabled"
msgstr "— Desactivado"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/OpenGraphPanel.php:153
msgid "✓ Active — locale tags only (og:locale, og:locale:alternate)"
msgstr "✓ Activo — solo etiquetas de idioma (og:locale, og:locale:alternate)"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/OpenGraphPanel.php:155
msgid "✓ Active — full OG + Twitter Cards"
msgstr "✓ Activo — OG completo + Tarjetas de Twitter"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/OpenGraphPanel.php:160
msgid ""
"Legacy lf-social-share mu-plugin detected. LF is deferring the base OG set "
"to the mu-plugin and outputting og:locale + og:locale:alternate only. You "
"can deactivate the mu-plugin — LF's built-in Social Share (SEO → Social "
"Share tab) and Open Graph cover the same functionality."
msgstr ""
"Se detectó el plugin mu legada lf-social-share. LF delega el conjunto OG "
"base al plugin y solo genera og:locale + og:locale:alternate. Puedes "
"desactivar el plugin mu — LF's Social Share incorporado (pestaña SEO → "
"Social Share) y Open Graph cubren la misma funcionalidad."

#. translators: %s: comma-separated list of SEO plugin names
