msgid "Output Article or WebPage schema on singular posts and pages"
msgstr ""
"Generar esquema Article o WebPage en publicaciones y páginas singulares"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/SchemaPanel.php:123
msgid ""
"Blog posts use Article; all other post types and pages use WebPage. Includes "
"headline, description, inLanguage, url, datePublished, dateModified, image, "
"and publisher."
msgstr ""
"Las publicaciones de blog usan Artículo; todos los demás tipos de "
"publicaciones y páginas usan Página Web. Incluye titular, descripción, "
"inLanguage, url, datePublished, dateModified, imagen y publisher."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/SchemaPanel.php:134
msgid "WebSite"
msgstr "Sitio Web"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/SchemaPanel.php:143
