#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/SeoTab.php:45
msgid ""
"Configure hreflang, Open Graph, Schema.org, sitemaps, and social sharing for "
"every language on your site. Each section below handles one aspect of "
"multilingual SEO."
